# CAP Admin

- Own CDS schema and Fiori Elements admin UIs.
- `BusinessObjectConfig` must store Hub service path, entity set, destination, keywords.
- Seed DELIVERY from Hub metadata; do not invent OData paths.
- Scopes: Admin for config write; BusinessUser does not maintain BO/rate/cache.
